Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.49,0:02:15.54,OP,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE52FD3&\bord6\blur10\fad(150,150)}Woah
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.58,0:02:19.21,OP,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE52FD3&\bord6\blur10\fad(150,150)}Fique ao meu lado hoje também
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.21,0:02:22.21,OP,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE52FD3&\bord6\blur10\fad(150,150)}Vamos seguir enquanto seguro sua mão
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.21,0:02:26.00,OP,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE52FD3&\bord6\blur10\fad(150,150)}Anseio por um lugar onde eu possa brilhar
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.59,0:02:32.01,OP,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE52FD3&\bord6\blur10\fad(150,150)}Enquanto um som mágico ecoa
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.84,0:02:35.51,OP,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE52FD3&\bord6\blur10\fad(150,150)}Eu quero cantar com você
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.51,0:02:37.52,OP,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE52FD3&\bord6\blur10\fad(150,150)}Vamos cantar juntos
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.52,0:02:41.31,OP,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE52FD3&\bord6\blur10\fad(150,150)}Você é uma estrela que brilha intensamente
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.31,0:02:42.98,OP,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE52FD3&\bord6\blur10\fad(150,150)}Meu bubee, bubee, bubee love
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.40,0:02:45.86,OP,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE52FD3&\bord6\blur10\fad(150,150)}Podemos ser estrelas brilhantes
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.86,0:02:47.61,OP,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE52FD3&\bord6\blur10\fad(150,150)}Mesmo com o tempo passando,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.61,0:02:50.36,OP,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE52FD3&\bord6\blur10\fad(150,150)}é uma magia secreta
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.36,0:02:54.32,OP,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE52FD3&\bord6\blur10\fad(150,150)}Meu bubee, bubee, bubee love
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.32,0:02:57.04,OP,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE52FD3&\bord6\blur10\fad(150,150)}Ooh, ooh, ooh
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.04,0:02:59.08,OP,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE52FD3&\bord6\blur10\fad(150,150)}Você é meu pequeno companheiro
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.08,0:03:04.33,OP,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE52FD3&\bord6\blur10\fad(150,150)}Ei, bubee love
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.33,0:03:04.33,OP,,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&HE52FD3&\bord6\blur10\fad(150,150)}Bubee, bubee, bubee love
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.33,0:03:06.50,OP,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE52FD3&\bord6\blur10\fad(150,150)}Babe, babe, babe, babe, babe, babe, babe, babe, babe
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.96,0:03:08.46,OP,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE52FD3&\bord6\blur10\fad(150,150)}Babe, babe, babe
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.46,0:03:09.38,OP,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE52FD3&\bord6\blur10\fad(150,150)}Bubee, bubee
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.38,0:03:11.67,OP,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE52FD3&\bord6\blur10\fad(150,150)}B-U-B-E-E, bubee
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.67,0:03:13.05,OP,,0,0,0,,{=23=30}{\c&HE52FD3&\bord6\blur10\fad(150,150)}Bubee love
